          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE 1:  Float into Float3\n\nIn this example we are using the Float3 node to construct a float3 signal for the Fractal noise.\nA Triangle oscillator is used for the X (first value), the Y(second value)  is kept empty and a Sine oscillator is ued for the Z(third value).\nThe new float3 signal is used for the phase offset of the Fractal Noise node."
          }
        },
        "bounds": {
          "height": 659.9676513671875,
          "width": 986,
          "x": 269.5,
          "y": 401
        },
        "class": {
